{"id": "doc.mvcpp", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["ARCH_MVCPP", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "View\u2190Model BLOCK, Model\u2190View BLOCK, Controller\u2264300, print\u2209Controller, SQL\u2192DP only. Import rules: Controller\u2192Model+ViewPartner, View\u2192ControllerPartner only, Model\u2192\u2205UI. Enforced: mvc_check 0err.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 3, "refs": ["doc.partner", "doc.dp", "flow.boot"], "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.partner", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["ARCH_PARTNER", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "View\u2192I*ViewPartner(ABC), Controller\u2192I*View(ABC). ABC+@abstractmethod only. Console: virtual subclass register. Interfaces: Main/Chat/RAG/Agent +7 in agent/interfaces.py.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 5, "refs": ["doc.mvcpp"], "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.fast_agent", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["ARCH_FAST_AGENT", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "f-key / \u26a1FastAgent. ModalStack: GoalModal\u2192RunningModal\u2192ReflectionModal\u2192ResultModal. Auto-run pauses on reflection. FastAgentTUIView\u2192no-op IAgentViewPartner.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 7, "refs": ["doc.partner", "feature.f011"], "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "doc.provider", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["ARCH_PROVIDER", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "main\u2192ProviderRegistry.get_default(). TUIProvider\u2192TUIAdapter\u2192MainTUIScreen|IMainView. ConsoleProvider\u2192MainView|IMainView. Adapters=thin delegates. Fallback: TUI exception\u2192ConsoleProvider.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 9, "refs": ["doc.partner"], "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.command", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["ARCH_COMMAND", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "ui/screens/main/commands/. Command(ABC): __init__(key,controller), run(args). CommandParser\u2192CommandData. 10 concrete cmds, MainController.load_commands().", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 11, "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "doc.dp", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["ARCH_DP", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "ALL SQL \u2208 DP_* classes. DP_Session: session.db, DP_Rag: rag.db, DP_agent: agent_session.db. stdlib sqlite3, idempotent CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS. No ORM/Alembic. Enforced: mvc_check SQL_OUTSIDE_DP.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 13, "refs": ["doc.persist_convention"], "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.stack", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["ARCH_STACK", "TIER_REFERENCE"], "text": "Python uv, Textual TUI, LangChain LLM, OpenRouter(default)/OpenAI/Gemini/Ollama/llama.cpp providers, Chroma(local)/Pinecone(cloud) vectors, Tavily web, sqlite3 stdlib. opencode+.opencode/plugins/omt_enforcer.ts enforcement.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 15, "tier": "reference"}
{"id": "doc.config", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["ARCH_CONFIG", "TIER_REFERENCE"], "text": "opencode.jsonc\u2192deny:git,py,pip,env. omt_enforcer.ts\u2192process gate. AGENTS.md\u2192agent rules. mvc_check.py\u2192linter. new_feature.py\u2192scaffolder. omt_phase\u2192src/ edits, omt_complete\u2192phase advance.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 17, "tier": "reference"}
{"id": "doc.Decisions", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["ARCH_DECISIONS", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "No ORM/Alembic. Agent\u2192SessionSnapshot. Single-active goal\u2192GoalManager. Reflection AI-optional, skipped without AI. .env gitignored, OPENROUTER_API_KEY at boot. --no-tui or no TTY\u2192console.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 19, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "flow.boot", "kind": "flow", "tags": ["FLOW_BOOT", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "load_dotenv\u2192prompt API key\u2192main(). provider=TUIProvider if isatty AND not --no-tui else ConsoleProvider. initialize\u2192MainController\u2192create_main_view\u2192show(). TUI err\u2192ConsoleProvider fallback.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 3, "refs": ["doc.provider", "doc.mvcpp"], "tier": "core"}
{"id": "flow.nav", "kind": "flow", "tags": ["FLOW_NAV", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "on_mount\u2192push MainScreen. c\u2192chat, r\u2192rag, ag\u2192agent. typed\u2192run_command\u2192CommandParser\u2192Command.run. esc/q\u2192pop/quit. Dual-path: action_open pushes screen AND calls controller.show.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 5, "refs": ["doc.provider", "doc.command"], "tier": "core"}
{"id": "flow.agent_cycle", "kind": "flow", "tags": ["FLOW_AGENT_CYCLE", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "PERCEIVE\u2192sensors\u2192mem. DECIDE\u2192PolicyEngine\u2192command. ACT\u2192ToolRegistry\u2192result. REFLECT\u2192proposals. Inv1cmd/corr, tool-scoped, noAI\u2192skip.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 7, "refs": ["doc.agent_overview", "doc.mvcpp"], "tier": "core"}
{"id": "flow.demo", "kind": "flow", "tags": ["FLOW_DEMO", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "d/demo\u2192AgentDemoScreen. mount\u2192load\u2192clear\u2192seed\u2192submit\u2192policy\u2192auto 1cycle. r re-run, x reset, esc back. S1: FileReader. S2: KnowledgeAssistant multi-step\u2192read\u2192write\u2192idle.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 9, "refs": ["feature.f010", "doc.agent_overview"], "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "flow.chat", "kind": "flow", "tags": ["FLOW_CHAT", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "User\u2192ChatScreen\u2192ChatController.process\u2192HumanMessage\u2192stream(llm,history)\u2192chunk\u2192show_partial\u2192AIMessage\u2192show_stream. Controller builds AIService+openrouter. _extract_chunk: list/None.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 11, "refs": ["doc.partner", "doc.ui"], "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "flow.rag_ingest", "kind": "flow", "tags": ["FLOW_RAG_INGEST", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "i\u2192RagController\u2192Rag.web_ingestion. RagDB.insert\u2192Chroma\u2192WebExtract(TavilyMap+Extract)\u2192WebIngestionApp\u2192crawl\u2192JSONL\u2192TextSplitter(4000,200)\u2192concurrent aadd_docs\u2192Chroma.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 13, "refs": ["doc.rag", "doc.persist_rag_schema"], "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "flow.rag_query", "kind": "flow", "tags": ["FLOW_RAG_QUERY", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "question\u2192RagChatController\u2192Rag.query(prompt,history). RagQuery.ask\u2192history_aware_retriever\u2192retrieval_chain(stuff_documents)\u2192chain.invoke\u2192answer+sources\u2192RagChatHistory.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 15, "refs": ["doc.rag"], "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "flow.session", "kind": "flow", "tags": ["FLOW_SESSION", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "new\u2192SessionManager.create_new\u2192backupCurrent\u2192timestamp_dir\u2192initDB. each cmd\u2192insert_history. sess=working dir. RAG repos\u2192<sess>/rag/. agent_session.db\u2192session dir or \".\"", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 17, "refs": ["doc.persist_session_schema", "doc.session"], "tier": "core"}
{"id": "flow.persist", "kind": "flow", "tags": ["FLOW_PERSIST", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "Agent.persist\u2192Snapshot(config,volatile,policy,goals,reflex)\u2192DB.save\u2192PERCEIVE. resume\u2192clear_stale\u2192restore configN7,policyN3,goalsN8,volN1,reflexM2,reregisterC1\u2192AI reinjectedC3. AgentAdapter.create(resume)\u2192latest snapshotI1.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 19, "refs": ["doc.dp", "doc.persist_agent_schema", "doc.agent_overview"], "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.before", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["EXT_BEFORE", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "Before every change: 1.read WORK+AGENTS. 2.omt_phase\u2192type,scope,phase,feature. bug/minor/refactor\u2192declare. major/new_screen\u2192design_doc. Scaffold: new_feature.py. 3.mvc_check(0). 4.Tests: omt_skip{scope:tests}.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 3, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.cmd_add", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["EXT_CMD", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "1. Command subclass: __init__(key,controller), run(args)\u2192controller-only. 2. Register: MainController.load_commands\u2192add_command. 3. typed\u2192help auto. New screen: add controller.show_+screen triad \u00a7SCREEN.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 5, "refs": ["doc.command"], "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "doc.screen_add", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["EXT_SCREEN", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "MVC++ triad. 1.Scaffold: new_feature.py. 2.Triad: ctrl(I*VP)+view(I*V). 3.Console: UIConsole. 4.TUI: screen+adapter. 5.Wire: key\u2192show\u2192push. 6.Test: pilot e2e.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 7, "refs": ["doc.mvcpp", "doc.partner", "doc.provider"], "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "doc.tool_add", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["EXT_TOOL", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "1.Implement tools/<tool>.py: ISensor sense+schema; IActuator validate+act+schema. Hybrid: both. 2.Register: Agent._register_builtin_tools\u2192_safe_register_sensor/actuator(tool).", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 9, "refs": ["doc.agent_tools"], "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "doc.checklist", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["EXT_CHECKLIST", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "MVC++: View\u2209Model, Ctrl\u2192PartnerABC, SQL\u2192DP. Partner: ABC+abstractmethod, I*VP, ctor inject. Files: layer/screen/layer. Classes: Ctrl,View,Adapter,DP_*. TDD: major\u2192RED\u2192GREEN\u2192REFACTOR. Phase: phase pre-src, complete advance.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 11, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.quickref", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["EXT_QUICKREF", "TIER_REFERENCE"], "text": "New cmd\u2192commands/commands.py+main_controller.py. New screen console\u2192<screen>_controller+<screen>_view. New screen TUI\u2192+<screen>_screen+<screen>_adapter+provider.py. New tool\u2192agent/tools/<tool>+agent.py. New DP table\u2192schema_db.py+repositories+agent_db. New AI\u2192providers/LLMProvider+service.py factory.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 13, "tier": "reference"}
{"id": "feature.catalog", "kind": "feature", "tags": ["FEAT_CATALOG", "TIER_REFERENCE"], "text": "F001\u23f3Petri-net F002\u23f3RAG F004\u2705TUI F005\u2705FSTool F006\u2705Gate F007\u2705169t F010\u2705Demo F011\u2705Fast44t F020\u2705Nav54t F021\u2705TA30t F022\u2705TkV2. Empty: F008+F009.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 3, "tier": "reference"}
{"id": "feature.f001", "kind": "feature", "tags": ["FEAT_F001", "TIER_REFERENCE"], "text": "Petri-net session objectives. IGoalManager impl swapping stub agent/model/goal/manager.py. Scope unset, WORK.md pending.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 5, "tier": "reference"}
