{"id": "feature.f005", "kind": "feature", "tags": ["FEAT_F005", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "Agentic filesystem tools folded\u2192F007 ToolRegistry as FileSystemTool hybrid sensor/actuator. src/agentx/agent/model/tools/filesystem_tool.py.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 11, "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "feature.f006", "kind": "feature", "tags": ["FEAT_F006", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "OMT++ enforcement: mvc_check.py lint, new_feature.py scaffold, omt_enforcer.ts gate, omt_status.ts, opencode.jsonc deny rules. omt_phase\u2192src/ edits, omt_complete\u2192advance.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 13, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "feature.f007", "kind": "feature", "tags": ["FEAT_F007", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "Agent P\u2192D\u2192ACT\u2192R. GoalManager, PolicyEngine DSL, MemoryManager, ReflectionEngine critique/safety/propose, ToolRegistry. agent_session.db+Snapshot. 169tests, MVC++ 0/0. src/agentx/agent/.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 15, "refs": ["doc.agent_overview", "flow.agent_cycle", "flow.persist"], "tier": "core"}
{"id": "feature.f010", "kind": "feature", "tags": ["FEAT_F010", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "AgentDemoScreen. d/demo[1|2]\u2192seed+run. S1: FileReader, S2: KnowledgeAssistant multi-step. Fixed bug: tools reading cmd\u2192.action not .parameters. src/agentx/agent/view/tui/demo_screen.py.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 17, "refs": ["doc.agent_overview", "flow.demo"], "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "feature.f011", "kind": "feature", "tags": ["FEAT_F011", "TIER_EXTENDED"], "text": "Fast Agent Modal UX. f/\u26a1\u2192Goal\u2192Running\u2192Reflection\u2192Result modals. Single goal NL, auto-run pauses on reflection. ModalScreen marsh-dismissed. 44tests MVC++. src/agentx/agent/view/tui/fast_agent*.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 19, "refs": ["doc.agent_overview", "doc.fast_agent"], "tier": "extended"}
{"id": "feature.f020", "kind": "feature", "tags": ["FEAT_F020", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "MetaHarness Nav. Signals: SECTION,RULE,ERR,XREF. 4 tools omt_nav+list+map+quickref. nav-gate blocks grep/glob on docs. Defects1-4 fixed. 54tests. .opencode/plugins/omt_nav.ts.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 21, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "feature.f021", "kind": "feature", "tags": ["FEAT_F021", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "Think Anywhere. TA: thought-tags, grep-backed, inline. 5 tools omt_think+list+remove+check+suggest. Digest+think-gate, non-bypassable. Protected: .env*,README,uv.lock,LICENSE,.json. 30tests. .opencode/plugins/omt_think.ts.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 23, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "feature.f022", "kind": "feature", "tags": ["FEAT_F022", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "Think-v2: anchored THOUGHT_PATTERN, after:/symbol: insertion+comment_syntax map, string-context guard. Read-time inject once/session. Stale lifecycle+risk-first gate weight. Suggest AST ranker, reindex drift repair.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 25, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "xref.features_xref", "kind": "xref", "tags": ["FEATURES_XREF", "TIER_REFERENCE"], "text": "\u2192.meta/META_HARNESS.md SECTION:RULES,SECTION:TDD,SECTION:RIGOR. \u2192omt_agent_guide.md \u00a712Arrabits,\u00a713Checklist. \u2192subsystems.md Agent,RAG,Session,AI,UI,Demo,Utils. \u2192architecture.md,data_flow.md,persistence.md,extending.md.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 27, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.crosscutting", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["FEAT_CROSSCUT", "TIER_REFERENCE"], "text": "Persistence: sqlite3 no ORM, 3DBS session+rag+agent. AI-optional: reflect skipped without AI. Two UIs: Console+TUI share controllers via provider pattern. ~1060 tests including Textual pilot e2e.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 29, "tier": "reference"}
{"id": "doc.persist_convention", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["PERSIST_CONVENTION", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "stdlib sqlite3 only. No ORM/Alembic. DDL=idempotent CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS. DB created on first use. ALL SQL\u2208DP_*/Database classes, never controllers/views. Enforced: mvc_check SQL_OUTSIDE_DP.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 3, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.persist_dbs", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["PERSIST_DBS", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "3 DBs. session.db\u2192DP_Session\u2192history+users. rag.db\u2192DP_Rag\u2192ingestion. agent_session.db\u2192DP_agent\u2192snapshots+memory+policy+goals+reflection. Naming: session+agent both define SessionDatabase\u2192distinct modules.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 5, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.persist_agent_schema", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["PERSIST_AGENT_SCHEMA", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "agents(id,name,autonomy,cfg). snaps(agent,ver,volatile,policy,goals,ref_pos). mem(tier,cont,meta). policy(cond,action,pri,enab). goals(par,desc,type,status,pri,crit). rf(trace,critique,props). JSON blobs.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 7, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.persist_session_schema", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["PERSIST_SESSION_SCHEMA", "TIER_REFERENCE"], "text": "TableHistory(id,command,created_at). TableUser(id,name,age). _select_all allowlisted {history,users}. Command history stored per session.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 9, "tier": "reference"}
{"id": "doc.persist_rag_schema", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["PERSIST_RAG_SCHEMA", "TIER_REFERENCE"], "text": "TableIngestion(id,vector_db_path,created_at). RAG bulk data NOT in sqlite: Chroma vectorstore <repo>/db/ + JSONL docs <repo>/docs/.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 11, "tier": "reference"}
{"id": "doc.persist_filesystem", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["PERSIST_FS", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "local_sessions/\u2192current/\u2192session.db+agent_session.db+backup_<ts>+rag/<repo>/rag.db+Chroma db/+docs JSONL. Session dirs timestamped. Safe deletion allowed_list [local_sessions]. Agent sandbox_root\u2192session dir.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 13, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.persist_dp_classes", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["PERSIST_DP", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "SessionDatabase(session)\u2192history. RagDatabase\u2192ingestion. SessionRepository(agent)\u2192snapshot+latest. GoalRepo\u2192tree. MemoryRepo\u2192recent. PolicyRepo\u2192all. ReflectionRepo\u2192recent. All parameterised sqlite3 queries.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 15, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "xref.persist_xref", "kind": "xref", "tags": ["PERSIST_XREF", "TIER_REFERENCE"], "text": "\u2192data_flow.md \u00a79 Agent Persistence. \u2192architecture.md \u00a7DP Pattern. \u2192subsystems.md \u00a7agent.persist,subsys.RAG,subsys.session", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 17, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.agent_overview", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["SUBSYS_AGENT", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "MVC++ self-contained. P\u2192D\u2192ACT\u2192REF. Model: Agent+GoalManager+PolicyEngine+Memory+Reflection+ToolRegistry+persist. Controller: AgentController. View: console+tui. Wiring: AgentAdapter. Contracts: 8ABCPartners.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 3, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.agent_facade", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["SUBSYS_AGENT_FACADE", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "Agent(model/agent.py): single entry. API: run_cycle,submit_goal,update_policy,clear,persist/resume/load_snap,register/unreg/list_tools,execute/health,list_pend/approve,list_rules/goals,query_mem,get_status.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 5, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.agent_goals", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["SUBSYS_AGENT_GOALS", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "GoalManager\u2192IGoalManager. AND/OR tree, priority-activate. Single-active goal. update_status\u2192promote next PENDING. apply/revert_adjustment\u2192reflection-driven+rollback. load_from_repository\u2192restore tree(N8). clear\u2192empty tree.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 7, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.agent_policy", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["SUBSYS_AGENT_POLICY", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "PolicyEngine: evaluate ctx\u2192decision. DSL: tokenizer+AST, has_obs, goal_blocked, memory_match, AND/OR/NOT. add_rule_safely\u2192compile+conflict(<10p,>0.8overlap). Conflict: priority, tool+action overlap. Rules\u2192PolicyRepo.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 9, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.agent_memory", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["SUBSYS_AGENT_MEMORY", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "MemoryManager: volatile LRU+persistent repo. store/retrieve/consolidate/evict. export/import_volatile\u2192snapshot. apply/revert_update\u2192reflection. clear_volatile. context_memory_limit\u2192bounds.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 11, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.agent_reflection", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["SUBSYS_AGENT_REFLECTION", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "ReflectionEngine\u2192Entry(critique+proposals). critique\u2192strengths/weaknesses, safety\u2192deny-list, proposals\u2192GOAL/MEM/TOOL/POLICY+rollback. Approve: pending\u2192approve_proposal. AI-optional: skip if no AI wired.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 13, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.agent_tools", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["SUBSYS_AGENT_TOOLS", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "ToolRegistry: FileSystemTool(hybrid,MAX2000), RagSensorTool(hybrid), SessionTool(hybrid,save/status). _decision_to_command\u2192tool_id+action\u2192ActuatorCommand. Fixed: tools read command.action not command.parameters (F010).", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 15, "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.aontpresist", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["SUBSYS_AGENT_PERSIST", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "SessionDB (DBS) +4 repos: Goal+Memory+Policy+Reflection. Schema schema_db.py idempotent DDL. SessionSnapshot: config+v.taripol+mem+policy+goals+reflection_pos.\u2192persistence.md\u00a73.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 17, "refs": ["doc.persist_agent_schema", "flow.persist"], "tier": "core"}
{"id": "doc.agent_controllers", "kind": "doc", "tags": ["SUBSYS_AGENT_CTRLS", "TIER_CORE"], "text": "AgentController: submit_goal,run_cycle,update_policy,save_snapshot,list_*,approve,reset,load_demo,get_cycle. Session+Tool controllers thin. AgentScreen keys: q/r/s/d/esc.", "src": ".meta/doc/omt++/*.kb.omt", "line": 19, "tier": "core"}
